## Scope

This licence covers **content only**. The rest of the repository – `build.js`,
`lint.js`, the documentation, and the tooling – is licensed under the MIT
licence; see `../LICENSE`.

The generated HTML files in this directory (`audience.html`, `speaker.html`,
`print.html`, `print-notes.html`) are a mixture: the lecture text and assets
are CC BY-SA 4.0 as above, while the runtime JavaScript and CSS that `build.js`
inlines into them remain under the MIT licence.
